four atoms are hidden in an 8 x 8 box
beams enter at 1-8 along the top, 9-16 down the right side,
17-24 back along the bottom and 25-32 up the left side
commands: fire <1-32>, guess <row> <column>, done
> fire 1
beam 1: exits at 28
> fire 5
beam 5: exits at 15
> fire 9
beam 9: exits at 32
> fire 20
beam 20: reflected
> fire 13
beam 13: hit
